<section vertical-align="center" id="bbs005" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>Title plus body for one point: a working title, two short paragraphs, then evidence points on the big-bullets recipe, each a short title and one line, hugging under the text.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="6MhR2XXt9K"><h2 style="padding-right: 20%">Demand recovered faster than the plan assumed</h2><p style="padding-right: 24%">Orders returned to last year's level by the end of the second quarter, two quarters ahead of the forecast, led by repeat customers in the regional accounts.</p><p style="padding-right: 24%">The recovery was uneven. Three product lines made up most of the volume while the two newest lines stayed below their launch targets.</p><grid style="--marker-gap: 1em" vertical-sizing="hug" spacing="medium" marker-position="inline" marker-shape="rounded" marker-style="subtle" marker-size="large" marker="number"><grid-item colspan="20" padding="0 0 8pt" id="yYnn7B8qLE"><h4>Repeat customers</h4><p>68 percent of second-quarter orders.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="20" padding="0 0 8pt" id="dNHJxLu8wX"><h4>New lines</h4><p>41 percent of their combined launch target.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="20" padding="0 0 8pt" id="ry70ksFsFO"><h4>Regional accounts</h4><p>Fastest-growing segment for the third quarter running.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>